  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25600348",
      "title": "Redux & Async Code",
      "sourceHash": "aa9b31be513d313ab759569d7340516e8a026e5154d9e2c482637fc47ed2418b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "So now that we repeated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "these core Redux basics again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 8.88,
          "en": "let's dive into some brand new content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.88,
          "end": 11.37,
          "en": "and let's see how we can connect Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.37,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "with side effects and asynchronous code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 16.507,
          "en": "Now for this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.507,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "I'll continue using this basic application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 21.33,
          "en": "on which we worked, but now I want to add a backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.33,
          "end": 24.033,
          "en": "A server to which we can send our cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.28,
          "end": 28.14,
          "en": "Because my idea is that whenever I edit the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.14,
          "end": 29.76,
          "en": "because we add items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.76,
          "end": 33.72,
          "en": "or we reduce the quantity or remove items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.72,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "whenever that happens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 38.46,
          "en": "I wanna send a request to a backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 42.24,
          "en": "to store that updated cart on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 45.96,
          "en": "so that when we reload this front-end application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.96,
          "end": 49.8,
          "en": "we can fetch that saved cart from the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.8,
          "end": 52.62,
          "en": "load it and display it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "That is my goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 57,
          "en": "Now for that as a backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "I will again use Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 61.29,
          "en": "because it's that easy to use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.29,
          "end": 64.11,
          "en": "no backend code required, backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.11,
          "end": 65.25,
          "en": "which simply, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.25,
          "end": 68.13,
          "en": "makes our life as a developer a bit easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.13,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "Of course, if you are a node JS developer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 73.77,
          "en": "you could also build your own backend API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 75.75,
          "en": "and send requests to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 78.33,
          "en": "but that's simply not the focus of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.33,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "Node JS is a totally different topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 83.52,
          "en": "I got a dedicated course in this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 85.77,
          "en": "this course is about React instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.77,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "so we will focus on that now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.3,
          "en": "I'll use this backend here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.3,
          "end": 93.663,
          "en": "for my requests for this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.15100000000001,
          "end": 98.54599999999999,
          "en": "And now we got a couple of different kinds of requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.54599999999999,
          "end": 100.05,
          "en": "that should be sent to that backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.05,
          "end": 102.96000000000001,
          "en": "As I said, whenever the card changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.96000000000001,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "I wanna update it on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 107.7,
          "en": "So whenever I add or remove items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.7,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "to or from the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "I wanna update that backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "And when I reload the application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "I wanna fetch my storage data from the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 118.2,
          "en": "Because currently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 118.2,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "if we add something to the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 123.27,
          "en": "if we edit our cart, once I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.27,
          "end": 125.16,
          "en": "all that data is lost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "because currently we're not storing that cart anywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 131.79,
          "en": "And that's exactly the kind of problem I wanna solve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.79,
          "end": 135.15,
          "en": "by storing it on that Firebase backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.15,
          "end": 138.12,
          "en": "But how do we now integrate that backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 140.19,
          "en": "and the HTTP requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.19,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "that we need to send to that backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 145.89,
          "en": "into our React application that uses Redux?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 147.63,
          "en": "How do we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 147.63,
          "end": 148.74,
          "en": "Now keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 148.74,
          "end": 152.04,
          "en": "reducers must be pure, side effect free,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 152.04,
          "end": 153.6,
          "en": "and synchronous.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 153.6,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "So when we have any code that produces a side effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "or is asynchronous, like sending a HTTP request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 161.7,
          "end": 166.7,
          "en": "such code must not go into our reducer functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 166.71,
          "end": 170.16,
          "en": "So we can't send our HTTP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 173.07,
          "en": "inside of the reducers in our cart slice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 173.07,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "after we edited our state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "We can't go to the end of the reducer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 180.87,
          "en": "and then use the fetch API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 183.3,
          "en": "and send the request to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.3,
          "end": 186.81,
          "en": "This would totally be against the idea of Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 188.932,
          "en": "It would be super bad",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 188.932,
          "end": 191.04,
          "en": "and you must never do something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 191.04,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "Don't perform a side effect inside of your reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 197.46,
          "en": "No matter if it's synchronous or asynchronous,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 197.46,
          "end": 199.68,
          "en": "don't do it inside of the reducer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 199.68,
          "end": 201.96,
          "en": "and never run any asynchronous code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 201.96,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "in the reducer in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 207.6,
          "en": "So we can't send the HTTP request here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 207.6,
          "end": 210.36,
          "en": "after we are done updating our state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 210.36,
          "end": 213.06,
          "en": "Instead, when it comes to running such code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 217.32,
          "en": "we have two main options where to put such code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 217.32,
          "end": 219.81,
          "en": "We can execute it in the components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 219.81,
          "end": 221.94,
          "en": "So we can simply ignore Redux,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 221.94,
          "end": 224.01,
          "en": "if you want to call it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 224.01,
          "end": 227.79,
          "en": "Or we create something which is called a action creator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 227.79,
          "end": 230.55,
          "en": "which we only used indirectly thus far",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 230.55,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "which also would allow us to run asynchronous code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 234.06,
          "end": 236.82,
          "en": "or generally any side effect code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 236.82,
          "end": 239.583,
          "en": "These are our two main options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 240.45,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "Now, I wanna show you both options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 245.11,
          "en": "so that you see the differences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 245.11,
          "end": 247.76,
          "en": "and can make your own choice which option you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}